{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An experimental work simulator where all you do is type simple data into spreadsheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/Graphics__1_.png?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/1st_Gif.gif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the true joy and zen of a spreadsheet job without the worry of deadlines, bills, or deeper meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/3e6228b532272407d94c52adf3c9e97a.avif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/2nd_Gif.gif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Get lost in the rhythm of your typing as you fill your 1.000 quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove humanity's strong will and finish this modern herculean task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/446299bebbc23090370675f25710e6f7.avif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 90s inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing sound of rain easing you to the spreadsheet rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selected classical music as a non-intrusive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay so simple a baby could do it, but only a strong will could finish it</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815990?t=1752899611","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3815990?t=1752899611","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/6ca08534b1e002aa79240f6e1a81fbd899de2d27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752899611","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/6ca08534b1e002aa79240f6e1a81fbd899de2d27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752899611","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An experimental work simulator where all you do is type simple data into spreadsheets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/Graphics__1_.png?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/1st_Gif.gif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the true joy and zen of a spreadsheet job without the worry of deadlines, bills, or deeper meanings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/3e6228b532272407d94c52adf3c9e97a.avif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/2nd_Gif.gif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Get lost in the rhythm of your typing as you fill your 1.000 quota.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prove humanity's strong will and finish this modern herculean task.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/extras/446299bebbc23090370675f25710e6f7.avif?t=1752899611\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features :</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 90s inspired aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Soothing sound of rain easing you to the spreadsheet rhythm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Selected classical music as a non-intrusive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay so simple a baby could do it, but only a strong will could finish it</p></li></ul>","developers":["Rinanda Hidayat"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3815990/b9b26499be4269a480664709104f25718b9fef81/header.jpg?t=1752899611","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257156998,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156998/movie480.mp4?t=1752899609","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257156998/movie_max.mp4?t=1752899609"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/25715